From: canoziia <canoziia@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] deepseek-v4.1: fast sm80 prefill indexer (logits + top-512)

VLLM_DSV41_INDEXER_PREFILL_FAST (default 0). Long-context prefill indexer as
two CUDA kernels (native/dsv41_indexer, built into the image as
vllm/_dsv41_indexer_C.abi3.so): 8 query rows per block share each K tile
(4-stage cp.async, bf16 mma, same arithmetic order as the Triton kernel, so
the logits are bitwise identical) and also emit exact per-32-column maxima;
top-512 uses them to read only candidate groups (same index set, sorted by
column). 4096-row chunk at 114K KV: 80.2 -> 38.6 ms.

